    "statement": "In the residual full-V4 n=3 profile, the source-star graph is two disjoint K_(2,2,2) graphs, and the two stars above the complete coordinate fiber indexed by a label k have endpoint union N_G(k). The common-five source-facet theorem supplies K subset I with |K|=5 and forces N_G(k) subset I^c for every k in K, so K is independent. But the graph has independence number 2+2=4. Hence the actual n=3 component is impossible.",
